From d216f8439d14e0a11475495cf5445e05cc4a9da9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Feb 2026 11:11:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: Add D1 domain for STM32MP25 family

Add a new power domain D1 domain to manage device assigned to CA35
and working only in Run1, managed by CLUSTER_PD and CpuIdle,
but without limitation for wakeup for S2IDLE, managed by EXTI1
and RET_PD.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I1233f0c68bba42732eb6dc470b5eebaf6db441a7
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/434116
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/536979
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
